OL,3,GNEWSATourist tax rate of #5-per-night
OL,4,Aproposed for Highlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighland Council has proposed
OL,7,Ffixed-rate visitor levies to raise
OL,8,Fmoney to help pay for roads and
OL,9,Ffacilities used by tourists.
OL,11,FUnder draft plans, a tourist tax of
OL,12,F#5-per-room, per-night could apply to
OL,13,Fhotels, guest houses, B&Bs, rooms in
OL,14,Fhouses and short-term lets.
OL,16,FThe proposed charge for hostels and
OL,17,Fcampsites would be #2-per-night.
OL,19,FThe levies would apply across the whole
OL,20,FHighland Council area for nine months
OL,21,Fof the year, excluding December,
OL,22,FJanuary and February.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
